abstract: >
  Reproducible wind energy benchmark suite and verification harness for the
  ECO-WIND project, developed under EU Erasmus+ CBHE ECO-WIND (Grant No.
  ERASMUS-EDU-2025-CBHE-101177220). Synthetic reference inputs are lightweight
  and self-contained under a zero-duplication data policy, respecting a <= 150 MiB
  peak RSS budget on 8 GB RAM systems.
